SUMMARY:Jizo Peace Project January  — Sebastopol Center For the Arts\, C
 alifornia
DTSTART:20270108T000000
DTEND:20270109T000000
UID:d461a21ddeac712f3ef13ad480859c07@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Jizo Peace Project: Clay Gathering for Remembrance and Peace\n
 \n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $10.00\n        \n      \n    \n  
 \n\nFirst Fridays\, dates listed below. Please select the date you plan to
  attend.  1:30 – 4:00pmDue to limited capacity\, we are asking for a sug
 gested donation of $10 to the Sebastopol Center for the Arts to confirm yo
 ur attendance. Bring a copy of your receipt at check-in to Painting/Drawin
 g Studio adjacent to Ceramics Studio. Additional donations are welcome at 
 the time of the class to cover rental and expenses for the peace project. 
 Class Description:Join us for a monthly\, heart-centered gathering where w
 e come together to create Jizo guardians out of clay—symbols of compassi
 on\, protection\, and peace. Rooted in the Buddhist tradition and echoed a
 cross many cultures\, Jizo figures traditionally honor children and all wh
 o have passed\, those in transition\, and those in distress.This ongoing p
 roject is dedicated to remembering those lost to war\, with a special focu
 s now on the approximately 19\,000 children who have perished in Israel an
 d Gaza in recent years. Through the simple\, meditative act of working wit
 h clay\, we create benevolent beings that will become part of public exhib
 its and peace sites\, offering spaces for reflection\, mourning\, and hope
 . Our gatherings conclude with a gentle ritual to honor the lives of these
  children.Located in the Painting & Drawing Room. The gathering is open to
  ages 12 - adult\, and no prior clay experience is necessary—all clay an
 d basic materials are supplied. Registration is required to participate.Do
 nations to Dharma Heart Zen are welcome to help cover materials and expens
 es. More than a class\, this is a shared space of warmth and care—an opp
 ortunity to tend to our own hearts while taking part in love in action. \n
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                  Dates:\n                \n\n\n\n          
             Select Dates\n                    \nJanuary 8th\, 2027\nFebrua
 ry 5th\, 2027\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\
