    \n          $170.00\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nWinter Treasures: Wa
 tercolor Basics Saturday\, January 16th\, 202710:00am-4:00pm$130.00 + $40.
 00 Materials Fee = $170.00 Attendance Price Celebrate the quiet beauty of 
 winter with watercolor inspired by Sonoma County's woodlands and cottage g
 ardens—from mushrooms\, mosses\, lichens\, evergreen branches\, seed pod
 s\, and winter berries to flowering quince\, camellias\, cyclamen\, and wi
 nter citrus. Learn basic watercolor techniques including wet-on-wet painti
