 on while creating expressive paintings inspired by the season.All material
 s provided. Space limited to 12 students.Discussion break at 12:30 p.m. Pl
 ease bring a brown bag lunch.About the Instructor: Lynn Zachreson studied 
 art at the University of Minnesota and San Jose State University—Paintin
 g\, Printmaking: BA Fine Art. She is a member of Sebastopol Gallery and ha
 s taught watercolor painting for over 30 years\, including watercolor figu
 re painting and Fine Art Basics with Mixed Media. Lynn enjoys painting\, t
 eaching\, long-distance hiking\, and gardening. View her work at lynnzachr
